### 聊天完成请求
POST http://localhost:3000/ark/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "doubao-seed-1-8-251228",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hello, how are you?"
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "max_tokens": 100
}

### 带系统消息的聊天请求
POST http://localhost:3000/ark/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "doubao-seed-1-8-251228",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a helpful assistant."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What is 2+2?"
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.5,
  "max_tokens": 50
}

### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:3000/health
